  "id": "section-570",
  "title": "对张闻天信的批示",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/4-146.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>146)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　印发各同志，印一百六十多份，发给每人一份，走了的，航送或邮送去。我以极大热情欢迎洛甫这封信。<br>\n<br>\n<p>　　毛泽东八月十八日</p>\n<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/4-146.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/4-147.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
